<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan T$15 bln T-bills' average yield 5.122 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan T$15 bln T-bills' average yield 5.122 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Tuesday it auctioned T$15 billion of 182-day treasury bills with an average yield at 5.122 percent.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$60.45 billion.</p>
<p>The range of the bids was between 5.000 and 5.180 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank completed the auction on behalf of the finance ministry.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-6080815)</p>
